  "description": "XOSTOP crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C160 H180 Eu4 Mn2 O34 S16,7.55(C1 H1 Cl3),5.32(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1O (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1N (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1N (Mn) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.314-4.749 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.38-175.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Mn2Eu4(L)4(H2O)2]·(H2O)5.3(CHCl3)7.6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
